privacy=ph('Privacy Policy','How Top Shelf handles website and audit-request information.','Effective July 16, 2026. Review before production when final systems are confirmed.')+f'<section><div class="wrap prose"><h2>Information collected</h2><p>We may collect submitted contact and business details plus referral parameters.</p><h2>How it is used</h2><p>To respond, prepare an audit, evaluate fit, maintain records, and meet security or legal obligations.</p><h2>Providers and messages</h2><p>Approved hosting, CRM, email, text, scheduling, security, and measurement providers may process data. With consent, we may contact you about the audit. Rates may apply; consent is not a purchase condition; reply STOP to opt out.</p><h2>Your choices</h2><p>Request access, correction, deletion, or preference changes at <a href="mailto:{EMAIL}">{EMAIL}</a>. Do not submit passwords or customer data.</p></div></section>';write('privacy/index.html','Privacy Policy | Top Shelf Agency','Privacy information for the Top Shelf website and Growth Audit request.',privacy)
